data: {"delta":{"text":"Campaign concluded with `--outcome campaign-met`. Summary:\n\n- Accepted dev's briefing confirmation, then dispatched the implementation task (d002).\n- Dev delivered `src/greet.py` (`greet(name)` → `\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\"`) and `tests/test_greet.py` covering a normal name and the empty string, committed on its own branch.\n- I independently verified — fetched dev's branch, ran the test suite in an isolated copy myself (exit 0), and checked the diff was scoped to just those two files — before accepting.\n- Fast-forward merged the accepted commit onto my own branch (`cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>`) and re-verified tests there.\n- Wrote a durable report to `~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/report.md` and replied to mission `m1` closing the campaign.","type":"text_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

